# Demonic Counsel with exactly four card types among cards in the graveyard (artifact Black Lotus, instant Entomb, creature
# Grizzly Bears, land Swamp): "instead" search for any card - Memnite, not a Demon, can be taken, it isn't revealed, and the
# Demon-card search does not also happen.

